<div class="methodology-note">
    <strong>Data source:</strong> Meta Ads API (act_9633160773399349) via export_insights at ad level.<br>
    <strong>Leads:</strong> Pixel lead events. <strong>Engagement:</strong> Reactions + comments + shares + saves.<br>
    <strong>Insights:</strong> Account-relative P25/P75 percentiles with contextual alert rules and suppression.<br>
    <strong>Lifecycle:</strong> LEARNING (&lt;7 days or &lt;1K impressions), REPORTABLE (meets thresholds), FATIGUED (30+ days with declining CTR).<br>
    <strong>Strategy recommendations:</strong> Based on account-relative percentiles across active ads.
